# ===== .gitignore (v4) =====
# Policy: the repo carries the DESIGN and the NOTES.
#   tracked : *.sv, *.xdc, Vivado projects (*.bit), Logisim schematics (*.circ),
#             SPICE netlists (*.cir), notes (*.md)
#   local   : tools/ (python scripts), generated images (*.png),
#             generated evidence tables (*.txt), waveforms (*.vcd)
#
# Vivado project files (.xpr, .runs, .sim, .hw, .bit, .dcp, .rpt, .jou, .log) are kept.

# --- python tooling: kept on the author's machine only ---
tools/

# --- generated images: logic diagrams, waveforms, application circuits ---
**/*.png

# --- generated evidence tables (Logisim truth table, SPICE result table) ---
**/logisim_table.txt
**/logisim_vectors.txt
**/spice_table_*.txt

# --- bitforge artifacts (never track) ---
**/*bitforge*/
*bitforge*

# --- derived files from manual iverilog runs (not Vivado) ---
tb.vvp
wave.vcd
sim.log
sim_ascii.txt
compile.log

# keep Vivado-generated waveforms inside project runs
!**/project_*/**/wave.vcd

# --- OS junk ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- python cache ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- SPICE scratch folders (raw, log, vcd sinh ra khi mo phong) ---
**/sim/

# --- Local only (not tracked) ---
DEC_ENC/
DIGITAL_SYSTEMS/
FSM_LAB/
IC_SV/
MUX_DEMUX/
SEQ_CIRCUITS/
playground/
REPORT_EVIDENCE.md
SUBSTRATE.md
